WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
If this is your prep, this video will walk you through exactly how to take it.

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.120
Just follow along step by step.

3
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:11.800
Your prep contains three packets, one Mango flavored packet and two Fruit Punch

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.480
packets.

5
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.560
You'll also need the mixing container that comes with it and water.

6
00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.400
Start with your first dose.

7
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.560
This is the Mango packet and you'll take it the evening before your procedure.

8
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.720
Open the Mango packet and pour it into the container.

9
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:29.780
Add 16 ounces of water up to the fill line, shake or stir it until it's

10
00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:30.800
completely dissolved.

11
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.800
Now take your time, slowly drink all of it within 30 minutes.

12
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.320
There's no rush, just keep sipping steadily.

13
00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:41.680
Once you've finished, refill the same container or a 16 ounce cup with water.

14
00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:44.720
Drink this glass of water within 30 minutes too.

15
00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:48.440
Your second dose happens 12 hours after the first.

16
00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.320
This time you'll use both Fruit Punch packets.

17
00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.960
Open both Fruit Punch packets and pour them into the container.

18
00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:01.800
Add water to the 16 ounce fill line and shake or stir until dissolved.

19
00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:05.920
Just like before, slowly drink all of it within 30 minutes.

20
00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:10.660
Then refill the container with 16 ounces of water and finish that within 30

21
00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:11.240
minutes.

22
00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:14.400
The timing of this second dose is really important.

23
00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:18.900
Make sure you take it at the right time so your prep is as effective as

24
00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:19.120
possible.

25
00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:21.800
You must drink all of the prep solution as directed,

26
00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:24.120
even if you're already passing clear liquid.

27
00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:28.920
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

28
00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.960
the clearest view during your procedure.

29
00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:35.730
If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may need to reschedule and neither

30
00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:36.480
of us wants that.

31
00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:41.260
After you've finished each dose, keep drinking clear liquids throughout the

32
00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:41.760
evening.

33
00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:46.160
Staying hydrated will help you feel better and help the prep do its job.

34
00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:50.610
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying

35
00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:53.760
a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

36
00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:56.240
That's it. You've got this.

37
00:01:56.240 --> 00:02:00.040
Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay hydrated.

38
00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:04.540
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office. We're here

39
00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:05.000
to help.
